==Event Information==
A new Angel threat arrives in the Cat Empire! The {{Color|#FF0000|'''EVANGELION'''}} and Battle Cats Crossover Event is back!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''March 1st (11am) through March 15th, 2021 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Capsules, with a new series of Ubers!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of your favorite Evangelion characters in TWO special crossover Rare Capsule sets!<br>
Along with all the powerful returning units only available during this collab event, this newest edition includes the brand new Uber Rare set {{Color|#335599|'''Evangelion 2nd Strike!'''}} Plus, new Rare Unit {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Kaworu Cat'''}} is available to collect from both the original Evangelion Collab Capsules and Evangelion 2nd Strike sets!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Units available in the Evangelion Collab Capsule set include:'''}}<br>
[[EVA Unit-08 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Eva Unit-08 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area Attacks have a chance to knockback, freeze and weaken Floating enemies, and deliver extra damage to Eva Angel type enemies while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[AAA Wunder (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''AAA Wunder (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver massive damage to Angels and Zombies!<br>
[[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Eva Unit-00 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angels & Floating, and negates Wave attacks! Area attacks gain increased damage and defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-01 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Eva Unit-01 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong versus Alien & Zombie enemies! Area attacks power up as it takes damage, and destroys Barriers! Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Eva Unit-02 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-Range Area strikes and massive damage vs Red enemies!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Shinji Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Shinji Cat (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Knocks back Metal & Black with area-effect Wave Attacks!<br>
[[Moon Operators (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''Moon Operators (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks slow Red & Zombies! Plus, kills Zombies permanently and prevents them from reviving!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Units available in the Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule set include:'''}}<br>
[[Night Oracle Rei (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Night Oracle Rei (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Traited enemies, with Surge attacks and 100% Slow. Plus, extra attack damage and tougher defense vs Eva Angels!<br>
[[The 4th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''The 4th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver massive damage & have Knockback vs Black enemies.<br>
[[The 6th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''The 6th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Long-Range Area damage & Slow vs Floating enemies, with Surge attacks too!<br>
[[The 9th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|'''The 9th Angel (Uber Rare)''']]<br>
Long-range Area Damage & Weaken vs Alien enemies, with Surge attacks too!<br>
[[The 10th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''The 10th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Omnistrike Damage & Freeze vs Angelic enemies, plus Surge attacks!

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Plus, Rare and Super Rare units available from both sets:'''}}<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare Cat)|'''Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare)''']]<br>
Tough vs Black enemies, with a chance to Weaken them!<br>
Delivers extra damage to Eva Angel enemies, while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to break barriers and Slow Aliens!<br>
[[Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to weaken Aliens!<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Rei Ayanami (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might weaken Angels!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Asuka Langley (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Asuka Langley (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Red Enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Mari Illustrious (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
'''[[Kaworu Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Kaworu Cat (NEW)}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Rei Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Rei Cat}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Asuka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Asuka Cat}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Mari Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Mari Cat (Rare)}}]]'''<br>
Awesome limited edition Rare Cat versions of the Evangelion heroes!<br>
<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the Evangelion collab units from the Evangelion / Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule sets. Evangelion / Evangelion 2nd Strike units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. If you wish to draw collab units, please make sure that you have selected the Evangelion or Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If Evangelion Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Evangelion Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Face off against terrifying collab-only enemies with your army of Evangelion characters!

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・Limited Stages "Evangelion Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collaboration to test your Cats at Evangelion collab stages!<br>
Clear the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Evangelion Activates!"'''}} stage for a change to receive the collab unit Shinji & Cat!
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Shinji & Cat!'''}}]] (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
Clearing {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Decisive Battle!"'''}} will earn you huge XP rewards!<br>
※Activate Shinji & Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Players who have already collected Shinji & Cat from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Defend Tokyo-3 Against the Angel menace!'''}}<br>
The collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}} with extra-tough stages will be available at the times listed below! Can you smash the cruel Angels and hold off Third Impact?

・'''Even Dates (3/2, 3/4, 3/6, 3/8, 3/10, 3/12, 3/14)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Odd Dates (3/1, 3/3, 3/5, 3/7, 3/9. 3/11, 3/13)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Last Collab Date (3/15)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the limited edition collab character [[Giraffe Unit-01 (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Giraffe Unit-01! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
<small><small>※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version<br>
※Players who have already collected Giraffe Unit-01 from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Challenge the Ultimate Refusal Type Angel!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''5 days from the start of the collab, (3/6)'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!

・'''Even Dates (3/6, 3/8, 3/10, 3/12, 3/14)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Odd Dates (3/7, 3/9, 3/11, 3/13)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Last Collab Date (3/15)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the True Form of limited edition collab character {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Kaworu & Cat'''}}! Can you conquer these super-tough stages and pick up Kaworu's 3rd form?
<small><small>※Upgrade Kaworu & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Kaworu & Cat's True Form!<br>
※Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Kaworu & Cat's True Form.<br>
※Players who have already collected Kaworu & Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.</small></small>

<div style="background-color: var(--color-min-contrast);border: solid 2px red;border-radius: 6px;padding-inline: 1rem;padding-bottom: 1rem;">
※NOTICE※<br>
Kaworu & Cat is a bonus reward unit that is planned to be delivered to all players in the 2nd half of the Collab Event if the conditions of the Battle Cats-Evanglion social media event are met. If "The 10th Angel Strikes!" is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may pick up the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.</div>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A weapon that should not exist! Face down the terrifying Unit-13!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''For the final half of the collab (starting 3/8 at 11:00am)'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!

・'''Even Dates (3/8, 3/10, 3/12, 3/14)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''9:00am～10:59am / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Odd Dates (3/9, 3/11, 3/13)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 7:00pm～8:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Last Collab Date (3/15)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clear the stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Shinji ＆ Cat's True Form!'''}}<br>
Plus, collect a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food reward the first time you clear the final stage'''}} in the map!<br>
<small><small>※ Upgrade Shinji & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※ Shinji & Cat can be collected from the "Evangelion Activates!" stage.<br>
※ Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Shinji & Cat's True Form!<br>
※ Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Shinji & Cat's True Form.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Defeat a relentless gauntlet of Angels in collab-only challenge stage!'''}}<br>
Visit the Event/Legend Stages to challenge the all-new map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Heralds of the End!'''}}<br>
Can you defeat a weird and terrifying parade of Eva Angels and reach Level 20? Each stage cleared will unlock the next, tougher stage with even more rewards!<br>
Plus, collect a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food reward the first time you clear the final stage'''}} in the map!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Gamatoto Expedition Areas!'''}}<br>
Evangelion themed Gamatoto area {{Color|#FF0000|'''NERV HQ'''}} will be available until March 8th at 10:59am! After that, a mysterious new expedition area will appear from March 8th at 11am...<br>
Don't miss out on bonus rewards - send your Gamatoto gang to these special stages before they disappear!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Evangelion events!<br>
<small><small>※Evangelion Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until March 15th, 2021 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards! Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the Special Collab Unit "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats"<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Once received, you can unlock "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Players who have already collected Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.</small></small>

